  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">GC - Support to Electoral cycle 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">In anticipation of the upcoming elections (Parliamentary in 2023, Presidential in 2025) in Guinea-Bissau, the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) is initiating a new electoral cycle support project, &#x201c;Support to the Electoral Cycle (PACE) 2023-2025&#x201d;, with direct link to the United Nations Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework for Guinea-Bissau 2022-2026 (UNSDCF) Strategic Priority 1 on &#x201c;Transformational and Inclusive Governance Encompassing Respect for the Rule of Law and Sustaini</narrative>
  </description>
